 "note": "WDI IS.AIR.DPRT; original source ICAO. Counts domestic takeoffs and takeoffs abroad by carriers registered in each country. These are carrier-registration totals, not departures from the country, passenger numbers or a measure of airspace closures. Annual totals are fixed to 2019/2020/2021. Percentage of 2019 is derived by Orbis only for non-zero known baselines; missing observations stay null. Country aggregates are excluded from map values; the separately reported World series is retained.",
